		<scenario>
			<name>The Rescued Mandalorian</name>
			<summary>An ex-force wielder turned Mandalorian bounty hunter is on a journey to save his daughter from the Sith.</summary>
			<description>Krup Voosh was once a powerful force wielder, until he was cut off from the force very tragically and suddenly. He fell from his position of power and wandered the galaxy, eventually falling in love with a Miraluka and, unbeknownst to Krup, having a child. 

Into his retirement, still wandering, he received a mysterious message from a girl kidnapped by the Sith for imminent training and indoctrination into their order.</description>
			<playerFaction>
				<def>PlayerFaction</def>
				<factionDef>OuterRim_MandoPlayerFaction</factionDef>
			</playerFaction>
