					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Force_Coruscant</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Jedi Code</name>
						<adjective>The Code</adjective>
						<memberName>Jedi</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Grand Master</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Grand Master</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"In all my years spreading our truth, I learned one lesson that stands over all: You don't use your mind as a weapon, your mind IS the weapon. You don't just use it for offensive purposes, or it is wasted. It became so clear after I finally ripped the metal from my body and peeled away the filthy tattooed skin."

  - Alanah 'Jumper' Mouton, Address on the swamp</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"In all my years spreading our truth, I learned one lesson that stands over all: You don't use your mind as a weapon, your mind IS the weapon. You don't just use it for offensive purposes, or it is wasted. It became so clear after I finally ripped the metal from my body and peeled away the filthy tattooed skin."

  - Alanah 'Jumper' Mouton, Address on the swamp</descriptionTemplate>
