						</foundation>
						<name>Republic Law</name>
						<adjective>Republic</adjective>
						<memberName>Citizen</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Senator</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Senator</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"I watched as a general courted favor with his rivals while leaving his battle droids to die on the battlefield. I vowed then to never be like him, knowing that my death, and yours, will mean nothing, as long as our people go on. A well-defended city is resilient. A city built with love is invincible."

  - Yorko Semenzin, Address in the settlement</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"I watched as a general courted favor with his rivals while leaving his battle droids to die on the battlefield. I vowed then to never be like him, knowing that my death, and yours, will mean nothing, as long as our people go on. A well-defended city is resilient. A city built with love is invincible."

  - Yorko Semenzin, Address in the settlement</descriptionTemplate>
