					<li>
						<overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>Mos Throne Room</overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Kemia</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Urban Desert Dweller</name>
						<adjective>Scum</adjective>
						<memberName>Villainy</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Daimyo</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Daimyo</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The cities of the desert are harsh settlements where a fight for survival is daily life. Robberies, murder, and backstabbing are frequent occurances in the isolated and resource starved cities, and the occupants are a grim reflection of their desolate surroundings. At the top of the chain is a daimyo, a leader and guardian of the desert settlement who rules with an iron fist, demanding a large tribute in return.</description>
						<descriptionLocked>True</descriptionLocked>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>Ideoligion_OrnateD</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Grey</colorDef>
						<memes>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
							<li>VME_Royal</li>
							<li>VME_Trader</li>
							<li>AM_Sadist</li>
						</memes>
