						<leaderTitleMale>Admiral</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Admiral</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In a world of every man for himself, Iris Kaluhikaua began a new family of strangers, bringing many different people together. Kaluhikaua punished those who tried to harm the unbelievers, as well as those who invited them into the believers' house. Some of the false believers tried to break the rules and decide their own paths. Kaluhikaua punished them severely.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In a world of every man for himself, Iris Kaluhikaua began a new family of strangers, bringing many different people together. Kaluhikaua punished those who tried to harm the unbelievers, as well as those who invited them into the believers' house. Some of the false believers tried to break the rules and decide their own paths. Kaluhikaua punished them severely.</descriptionTemplate>
