						<description>"To: All Employees

From: Upper Management

Subject: Customer Satisfaction

We are very happy to have you as a part of our team. The staff here is looking forward to helping you fill the management void we have had for some time. This critical issue will be discussed in an all-hands meeting, ASAP. It is prioritary that we start thinking outside the box. And let's all sing from the same hymn sheet."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"To: All Employees

